{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding and Attachment System - Forge Your Deck!</strong><br>After every heart-pounding battle, you'll obtain powerful new cards to enhance your strategy. With the unique Card Attachment System, a single card can carry two different effects\u2014switch them freely to adapt to any challenge. Build a deck that is truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/9a3d50ad676e3526f9acdc7f97a4f09e.poster.avif?t=1766026618\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/9a3d50ad676e3526f9acdc7f97a4f09e.webm?t=1766026618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/9a3d50ad676e3526f9acdc7f97a4f09e.mp4?t=1766026618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient and Powerful Artifacts</strong><br>These ancient relics are the ultimate catalysts for your deck. Their true power lies not in standalone use, but in resonating with your card combinations to trigger chain reactions where <strong>1+1&gt;2</strong>, reshaping your entire tactical approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/ef5f6046b25de7ea04a021aef558d51d.poster.avif?t=1766026618\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/ef5f6046b25de7ea04a021aef558d51d.webm?t=1766026618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/ef5f6046b25de7ea04a021aef558d51d.mp4?t=1766026618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity System Warning</strong><br>Monster attacks erode both your <strong>HP and SAN</strong>. You don't want to find out what happens when sanity reaches zero...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/c2228e3aafb552cef007fee426cbc6f9.poster.avif?t=1766026618\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/c2228e3aafb552cef007fee426cbc6f9.webm?t=1766026618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/extras/c2228e3aafb552cef007fee426cbc6f9.mp4?t=1766026618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, it's time to set sail!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837690?t=1766026618","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/b4178b0e1a218221d6b3c1ccea69d62267a91e4d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766026618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/1d210d6505d49a0682d0dfae9f325008cee6cb71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766026618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837690/1d210d6505d49a0682d0dfae9f325008cee6cb71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766026618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding and Attachment System - Forge Your Deck!</strong><br>After every heart-pounding battle, you'll o